<p>				TIME (in IST)</p>
<p>	  1100	1200     1300	1400     1500	1600</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	 Bid/Ask  Bid/Ask   Bid/Ask   Bid/Ask  Bid/Ask   Bid/Ask</p>
<p>	 -------  -------   -------   -------  -------   -------</p>
<p>Nov -.50/1.50 0.75/1.50 0.75/1.50 0.50/1.00 0.50/1.00 0.00/1.00  Dec - 10/11     10/12     10/12	9/11	9/11	9/11</p>
<p> Jan - 29/32     31/33     30/32     30/32     29/32     30/33</p>
<p> Feb - 50/53     51/54     51/53     50/52     50/53     51/54</p>
